  "name": "Create outreach tasks for new B2B website visitors with Webmetic",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "2878ff56-b965-4e17-b2d5-5b8b668b5266",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Create outreach tasks for new B2B website visitors with Webmetic\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs every five minutes to check Webmetic for new B2B website visits, deduplicates companies, and filters for visitors with enough interest. It looks up matching HubSpot or any other CRM company and deal records, then either adds a task to an existing open deal or finds a contact, uses OpenAI to write a call script, creates records, and notifies the sales team.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the schedule interval if five minutes is not appropriate for your sales process.\n- Set the Settings node values for domain, minLeadScore, yourCompany, and whatYouSell.\n- Connect and authorize Webmetic credentials for visitor and contact lookup.\n- Configure HubSpot authentication for the HTTP Request and HubSpot nodes, including access to companies, deals, contacts, and tasks.\n- Connect OpenAI credentials for the chat model used by the AI Agent.\n- Connect Microsoft Teams credentials and choose the target team/channel for sales notifications.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the minimum lead score, HubSpot search criteria, call-task content, AI call-script prompt, and Teams notification message to match your qualification rules and sales workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "66d269e1-e9ef-4f98-815e-2af4eee43ae2",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        560,
        336
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Schedule and visit lookup\n\nStarts the automation on a timer, applies core configuration values, and retrieves recent website visits from Webmetic."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5abe99b4-4f1d-40ea-b28d-ac3bb41fe9ce",
