        "message": "=<b>New company on the website:</b> {{ $('Fetch Webmetic Visits').item.json.company_name }}, {{ $('Fetch Webmetic Visits').item.json.city }} (lead score {{ $('Fetch Webmetic Visits').item.json.lead_score }})<br><b>Contact:</b> {{ $('Find Contacts via Webmetic').item.json.name }}, {{ $('Find Contacts via Webmetic').item.json.job_title }}<br><b>Phone:</b> {{ $('Find Contacts via Webmetic').item.json.mobile_phone || $('Find Contacts via Webmetic').item.json.direct_phone || 'not available' }}<br>The contact and a call task with the call script are in HubSpot.",
